--- This patch adapts the firmadyne driver from the v4.1 kernel tree
--- to work with kernels in the 3.10.x to 4.0.x range.
--- Key changes:
---   - PDE_DATA() may not exist in older 3.10 (use PDE()->data)
---   - Some VFS function signatures differ
---   - proc_create_data vs older proc API

--- Note: This is a template patch. The actual adaptation is done
--- programmatically in build_kernels.sh via sed transformations,
--- because the exact changes depend on the specific sub-version.
--- 注意: 这是一个模板补丁。实际的适配在 build_kernels.sh 中
--- 通过 sed 转换以编程方式完成，因为确切的更改取决于具体的子版本。
